ited Nations System Code of Conduct UNTERM Visualizations and machine readability Home DGACM applications DGACM applications The Department for General Assembly and Conference Management (DGACM) employs a suite of digital tools to enhance efficiency in managing multilingual content, meetings, and documentation. These tools support knowledge sharing, bilingual text management, resource assignment for interpretation, computer-assisted translation, and content structuring. Additionally, they streamline document retrieval, verbatim text analysis, and centralized access to resources, while ensuring consistent use of multilingual terminology and compliance in reporting. Beyond DGACM, these tools are also utilized by its partners, such as regional commissions and other international organizations, to facilitate coordination and optimize conference and documentation workflows. Athena &nbsp;(DGACM staff only) Document Storage eAPG eAPG v2 eLUNa eLUNa Converter eLUNa Editorial eLUNa Search gData gDoc 2.0 gMeets One-Stop-Shop UNTERM Need help accessing these applications? For gDoc applications, contact: gdoc-support@un.org For gMeets applications, such as gMeets or public meeting displays, contact: gmeets-helpdesk@un.org For gText applications, such as eLUNa or UNTerm, &nbsp;contact: unovgtextsupport@un.org For gData applications, contact: gData2.0@un.org For eAPG, contact: dgacm-eapg-support@un.org Français 中文 Español Русский عربي Donate facebook twitter youtube flickr Footer A-Z Site Index Contact Copyright FAQ Fraud Alert Privacy Notice Terms of Use",
